<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian National Oil Q3 profit up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian National Oil Q3 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month trading result for Nigeria's leading petroleum marketing company National Oil to-end September.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		     3,600	3,500</p>
<p>Profit before taxation     424	  378</p>
<p>Taxation			 136	  140</p>
<p>Profit after taxation	288	  238</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
